 a specialty burrito! Check out the full menu on our website! Available Mon
 day-Friday\, 11:30 AM-5 PM!\n\nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/ev
 ent/burritos-%26-bowls%e2%80%94lunch-specials-at-yellow-door-taqueria!/111
 544/
LOCATION:Yellow Door Taqueria\, 191 Dorrance Street\, Providence\, RI 0290
 3
