BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Life on the Avenue: Immigration\, Protest\, and Triumph on Federal
  Hill
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261224
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261225
DTSTAMP:20261102T203001Z
UID:b647795e53ce8e44e67b534819a6@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Life on the Avenue: Immigration\, Protest\, and Triumph on Fed
 eral Hill is a powerful\, story-driven walking tour that goes beyond the n
 eighborhood’s celebrated food scene to uncover the journey for belonging
  that shaped it. As you explore one of Providence’s most iconic district
 s\, you’ll trace the journeys of Indigenous communities\, Irish and Ital
 ian immigrants\, and modern newcomers—each group navigating hardship\, d
 iscrimination\, and resilience in their fight to call this place home. Alo
 ng the way\, you’ll stand where protests erupted\, revolutions nearly ig
 nited\, and everyday people carved out lives against the odds. Blending ri
 ch storytelling with local flavor and insider food recommendations\, this 
 experience reveals Federal Hill not just as a destination—but as a battl
 eground where identity\, power\, and community have been contested for gen
 erations.\n\nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/life-on-the-av
 enue%3a-immigration-protest-and-triumph-on-federal-hill/111313/
LOCATION:Garibaldi Square\, 99 Atwells Avenue\, Providence\, RI 02903
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/life-on-the-avenue%3a-immigrati
 on-protest-and-triumph-on-federal-hill/111313/
END:VEVENT
